            witten-2012-superstring-perturbation 的 ref [45] 逐字），但**均未与 AMS 直证**。
            **可引编号（L1 逐字，v2 p.5）**：
            **Theorem 1.1** 「The supermanifold M_g is non-projected, and in particular non-split, for **g >= 5**.」
            紧跟括注 **「(We suspect that this result may hold for g >= 3.)」**；
            **Theorem 1.2** 「The supermanifold M_{g,1} is non-projected for g >= 2, **for the case of an even
            spin structure**.」；**Theorem 1.3** 「The supermanifold M_{g,n} is non-projected for g >= 2 and
            g-1 >= n >= 1. This holds for both even and odd spin structures if g is odd and for even spin
            structure if g is even.」；紧跟 **「We do not resolve the question of projectedness of M_{g,n} for the
            case of even g, odd spin structure, and n >= 1.」**
            **Remark 1.4**：**不考虑 Deligne--Mumford 紧化**（「Our assertion is that M_g and M_{g,n} are
            non-projected without any consideration of the compactification.」）；
            **Remark 1.6**：研究对象其实是 moduli **stack**。
            **⚠⚠ 最重要的一条红线（p.4 逐字）**：
            **「The validity of superstring perturbation theory does not depend on a projection, so the existence
            of string theory gives no hint that M_g is projected.」**
            => **不得把本文写成「对超弦微扰论的否定」或「对 PCO 方法的否定」。**
            被否定的是「先沿投影的纤维积分、再化约到普通模空间 SM_g」这一**策略**；
            摘要的物理句逐字是「certain approaches to superstring perturbation theory that are very powerful
            in low orders **have no close analog in higher orders**」。
